  <h1>Best carpool apps in California and Nevada for long-distance trips</h1>
  <div class="meta">Updated September 2026 · Prices are typical ranges; live seat prices are on each route page</div>

  <p class="lede"><strong>Short answer:</strong> for a booked-ahead seat between California and Nevada cities, Seat Sherpa is the only marketplace that verifies drivers, holds payment until pickup and caps prices at the IRS mileage rate. The other options that still exist in 2026 are unverified boards: Craigslist rideshare and Facebook groups. BlaBlaCar has never launched in the US, Waze Carpool shut down in 2022, Zimride is campus-only, and Hitch serves Texas and neighbouring states.</p>

  <h2>What actually works here in 2026</h2>
  <div class="scroll"><table class="stack">
    <thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Covers CA / NV intercity?</th><th>Driver verification</th><th>Payment</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td class="win">Seat Sherpa</td><td data-l="Covers CA / NV intercity?">Yes: SF Bay Area, LA, San Diego, Sacramento, Fresno, Santa Barbara, San Luis Obispo, Palm Springs, Napa, Reno/Tahoe, Las Vegas</td><td data-l="Driver verification">Phone, license, vehicle, Stripe identity, ratings</td><td data-l="Payment">In app or browser, held until the pickup code</td><td data-l="Price">Capped at the IRS rate split across seats, max $55 + 5% fee</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Craigslist rideshare</td><td data-l="Covers CA / NV intercity?">Yes, nationwide board</td><td data-l="Driver verification">None</td><td data-l="Payment">Cash or Venmo between strangers</td><td data-l="Price">Whatever is posted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Facebook carpool groups</td><td data-l="Covers CA / NV intercity?">Patchy, group by group</td><td data-l="Driver verification">Profile only</td><td data-l="Payment">None built in</td><td data-l="Price">Whatever is posted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Bay Area casual carpool</td><td data-l="Covers CA / NV intercity?">Commute only, East Bay to SF</td><td data-l="Driver verification">None</td><td data-l="Payment">Small cash contribution by custom</td><td data-l="Price">A few dollars</td></tr>
